<section xml:id="sec-equations-with-fractions" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Equations with Fractions</title>

	<objectives>
		<introduction>
			<p>
				In this section, we learn how to:
			</p>
		</introduction>
		<ol>
			<li><p>Solve equations with fractions present.</p></li>
			<li><p>Apply strategies for solving equations with fractions in real-world contexts.</p></li>
    </ol>
	</objectives>

